  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0515.synerithoi.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0515.synerithoi.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0515.synerithoi.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0515_synerithoi"><head>ΣΥΝΕΡΙΘΟΙ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="synerithoi" author_heading="TIMOCLES" work_heading="ΣΥΝΕΡΙΘΟΙ" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0515-synerithoi-synerithoi">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0515-synerithoi-synerithoi-l1">Benigna sequitur mortuos miseratio:</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0515-synerithoi-synerithoi-l2">vivos malignum nomen invidentia.</l>
              </lg>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" xml:id="meineke-0515-synerithoi-1">
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0515-synerithoi-1-l1">Τοῖς μὲν τεθνεῶσιν ἔλεος ἐπιεικὴς θεός,</l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0515-synerithoi-1-l2">τοῖς ζῶσι δ᾽ ἕτερον ἀνοσιώτατον φθόνος.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Stobaeus Florileg. CXXV 10</bibl> cum lemmate Τιμοκλέους Συνεργικά, de quo cfr Hist. crit. p. 433. Voss. Τιμοκλέους, omisso Συνεργικά. Trinc. Ἀρχιλόχου. Timocli idem locus tribuitur a <bibl>Theophilo ad Autolycum p. 378 f</bibl>: τούτοις ἀκόλουθα εἴρηκε καὶ Τιμοκλῆς λέγων <quote>Τεθνεῶσιν ἔλεος ἐπιεικὴς θεός.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Altero versu codd. ΑΒ ἀνοσιώτατος. Ibid. ἕτερον fortasse corruptum est.</note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>